---
title: Extension Ideas
---

# Extension Ideas
> Brainstorming extensions for the Nimbalyst marketplace. Green = Tier 1 (build ASAP), Blue = Tier 2 (build soon), Purple = Tier 3 (differentiation).

## Diagrams & Visual Editing {color: orange}
> Leverage Nimbalyst's bidirectional custom editors -- the single biggest differentiator vs VSCode/Obsidian.

### Mermaid WYSIWYG Editor {color: green, tags: tier-1, priority}
> Visual drag-and-drop node editing, not just preview. AI generates mermaid from descriptions. VSCode Mermaid Preview: 2M+.
### Excalidraw {status: in-progress, tags: exists}
> Exists somewhat, but not AI integrated yet.
### Flowchart Builder {color: blue}
> Drag-and-drop with smart connectors. Draw.io: 3M VSCode.
### PlantUML Editor
> Rich UML canvas with bidirectional code/visual editing. VSCode PlantUML: 1.5M.
### SVG Editor
> Visual SVG path editor with node manipulation.
### Slide Deck Presenter {color: blue, tags: tier-2}
> Markdown-to-reveal.js presentations with speaker notes.
### Timeline / Gantt Editor
### ASCII Art / Box Drawing
### Wireframe Kit
> Lighter-weight MockupLM focused on wireframing speed.
### Org Chart / Hierarchy Visualizer
### Network Topology Diagrammer
> AI generates from Terraform/CloudFormation.
### D3 Chart Designer
### Map Viewer
> Geographic map with markers. Obsidian Map View: 310K.

## Data & Spreadsheets {color: orange}

### JSON/YAML Visual Editor {color: blue, tags: tier-2}
> Tree-view and form-based editing with schema validation.
### Excel/XLSX Editor
> Full spreadsheet editing with formula support. VSCode Excel Viewer: 5M.
### Database Schema Visualizer
> ERD from Prisma/Drizzle schemas or live DB connections.
### Datamodels {status: done, tags: exists}
> Exists as a core plugin.
### SQL Notebook
> Jupyter-style notebooks for SQL with inline results and charts.
### Parquet/Arrow Viewer
### GraphQL Explorer
### Regex Tester
### Log Viewer
> Structured log viewing with filtering and pattern detection.

