## Knowledge Management {color: orange}
> Core Obsidian territory -- extensions here attract their user base.

### Wiki Links + Backlinks {color: green, tags: tier-1, priority}
> Obsidian's core draw, millions of users. [[wiki-style]] linking with backlink panel.
### Graph View
> Interactive force-directed graph of document links. Obsidian core feature.
### Dataview / Query Engine
> Query workspace files by frontmatter, tags, dates. Obsidian Dataview: 3.8M.
### Daily Notes / Calendar {color: blue, tags: tier-2}
> Calendar navigation, templates, periodic reviews. Obsidian Calendar: 2.4M.
### Tag Manager
> Bulk rename, merge, organize tags. Obsidian Tag Wrangler: 907K.
### Omnisearch
> Full-text search across all file types including PDFs/images via OCR. 1.3M.
### Readwise / Highlights Sync
### Zettelkasten System
### Bookmarks / Favorites
> VSCode Bookmarks: 4M.
### Mindmap / Brainstormer {status: done, tags: exists}

