## Themes & Appearance {color: orange}

### Theme Pack {color: green, tags: tier-1, priority}
> Catppuccin, Dracula, Nord, One Dark Pro, Monokai. Low effort, high install count.
### Theme Studio
> Visual theme designer with live preview of --nim-* variables. Obsidian Style Settings: 2.2M.
### Icon Pack Manager
> Material, Catppuccin, Seti icons. VSCode Material Icons: 20M.
### Font Manager

## Nimbalyst-Unique {color: purple}
> Extensions that leverage capabilities no other editor has.

### Session Analytics Dashboard {color: purple, tags: tier-3}
> Visualize AI session patterns, cost tracking, productivity metrics.
### Extension Builder {color: purple, tags: tier-3}
> Build extensions for Nimbalyst inside Nimbalyst. Dog-food the system.
### AI Session Replay
> Replay sessions step-by-step for review or tutorials.
### Workstream Burndown
> Multi-session project tracking with velocity metrics.
### Cross-File Refactoring Visualizer
### Document-First API Designer
> Write API docs in Lexical, AI generates OpenAPI spec + implementation.
### Multi-Format Note Hub
> Single note embedding multiple editor types inline.
### AI Pair Programming Replay
### Workspace Template Marketplace

